      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>A redcap's woolen hat is dyed with the blood of its victims.</p>\n<p>If the redcap loses its cap, it no longer benefits from fast healing and takes a -4 status penalty to its damage rolls. It can create a new cap in 10 minutes, but that cap doesn't grant its powers until the redcap has turned it red with Blood Soak.</p>\n<p>A cap has no benefit for creatures other than the redcap who made it.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-effects.s5mS7CyE0oOYlecv]{Effect: Red Cap}</p>",
