      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "Divine Revulsion",
      "sort": 800000,
      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>If a redcap sees a creature brandish a religious symbol of a good deity (which requires an interact action by that creature) or use one to cast a divine spell, the redcap must attempt a <span data-pf2-check=\"will\" data-pf2-dc=\"25\" data-pf2-traits=\"emotion,fear,mental\" data-pf2-label=\"Divine Revulsion DC\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\">Will</span> save.</p>\n<p>It then becomes temporarily immune to all brandished religious symbols for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The redcap is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The redcap is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The redcap gains the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition for 1 round and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}.</p>",
          "chat": "",
          "unidentified": ""
        },
